# Live sinks for the `file/raw_*` exporters. These are RUNTIME capture data,
# not fixtures: the collector appends to them continuously (measured 40-80 MB
# within an hour on the pg/pgcs lanes, and the detached recipe sink is ~90 GB
# per hour). The rig re-creates them on start -- pg-rig.sh mkdir -p's the lane
# directory and truncates the events file -- so nothing here needs to survive a
# clone. The checked-in evidence lives in captures/*.md and captures/*.json.
captures/raw/
captures/raw_*/
